      "message": "have you verified this is actually how Gerrit behaves ?  if git itself is rejecting it, then things built on top of git will/should reject it.\n\nif agents are generating incorrect tag style in git commit messages, that\u0027s a bug in the agent.",
      "revId": "f5e489091199dccabe43fca1e8bec484987ac3f9",
