      "writtenOn": "2026-07-30T23:43:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Gerrit does not reject pushes for such commit messages (that contain a single `Change-Id`).\n\nDid you test that with a project set to require Change-Ids? And did Gerrit set the Change-Id of the new change to be the same as the malformed Change-Id in the commit message? If neither of those is true, then Gerrit isn\u0027t honoring the Change-Id from the message and the hook is trying to do the correct thing by adding a properly formatted Change-Id footer.",
      "parentUuid": "9b277ed8_8be930a3",
      "revId": "f5e489091199dccabe43fca1e8bec484987ac3f9",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
